  "notes": "{覗|のぞ}く is a godan verb meaning to peek, peep, or look into something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for what you peek at/into\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{覗|のぞ}く: to peek through a window\n- ⟦{中|なか}→中：00654_naka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{覗|のぞ}く: to look inside\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{覗|のぞ}かせる: to peek one's face in\n- ⟦{望遠鏡|ぼうえんきょう}→望遠鏡：05483_bouenkyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{覗|のぞ}く: to look through a telescope\n- ⟦ちょっと→ちょっと：00595_chotto⟧{覗|のぞ}く: to take a quick look\n\nHOMOPHONE (different kanji):\n- ⟦{除|のぞ}く→除く：02391_nozoku⟧: to remove, exclude, except\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {覗|のぞ}き{込|こ}む: to peer into (more intently)",
